    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Fight with <i>Zack in Fight</i>!</strong><br><i>Zack in Fight</i> is a fast-paced 1v1 2D fighting game where the time-bending heroes and villains from the <i>Zack in Time</i> universe clash in epic battles! Featuring unique characters, combat mechanics, and Handmade 2D animations, it's the game for zack in time fans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Unique Characters from <i>Zack in Time</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse roster of time-hopping characters, each with unique abilities, combos, and fighting styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Local and Remote Multiplayer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against your friends in local couch co-op or use Play Together to play with your friends online.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stunning 2D Art and Animations</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous, hand-drawn characters and environments bring the <i>Zack in Time</i> universe to life with a vibrant, retro aesthetic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd17 <strong>Multiple Game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus Mode:</strong> Test your skills in quick battles against other players.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Fight and Rewrite Time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a seasoned fighting game pro or a time-traveling newcomer, <i>Zack in Fight</i> offers a fresh twist on classic brawlers. Ready your skills, perfect your combos, and prepare to <strong>Fight for the Future, the Past, and Everything In-Between!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong><br>Don\u2019t miss out on <i>Zack in Fight</i>! Add it to your Wishlist to be notified about updates, new characters, and release details.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Fight with <i>Zack in Fight</i>!</strong><br><i>Zack in Fight</i> is a fast-paced 1v1 2D fighting game where the time-bending heroes and villains from the <i>Zack in Time</i> universe clash in epic battles! Featuring unique characters, combat mechanics, and Handmade 2D animations, it's the game for zack in time fans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Unique Characters from <i>Zack in Time</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse roster of time-hopping characters, each with unique abilities, combos, and fighting styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Local and Remote Multiplayer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against your friends in local couch co-op or use Play Together to play with your friends online.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stunning 2D Art and Animations</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous, hand-drawn characters and environments bring the <i>Zack in Time</i> universe to life with a vibrant, retro aesthetic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd17 <strong>Multiple Game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus Mode:</strong> Test your skills in quick battles against other players.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Fight and Rewrite Time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a seasoned fighting game pro or a time-traveling newcomer, <i>Zack in Fight</i> offers a fresh twist on classic brawlers. Ready your skills, perfect your combos, and prepare to <strong>Fight for the Future, the Past, and Everything In-Between!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong><br>Don\u2019t miss out on <i>Zack in Fight</i>! Add it to your Wishlist to be notified about updates, new characters, and release details.</p>",
